  "remaining": [
    "Define a complete exact source closure, internal visibility and conditional-import/platform boundaries. Preserve existing public signature/default core/UUID/name/path/attributes and legacy appear/disappear behavior; preserve nil feature/NOP behavior. No PR12 concrete types introduced into the PR11 closure and no removal of keyed machinery without a separately reviewed design disposition.",
