    "Prove exact active-owner/feature replacement/stop invalidation, weak registration/callback lifetime and no retained stale On collaborator. Reusing the fetched feature Monitor is an opportunity, not evidence that retaining the feature/Monitor in SwiftUI state is safe or that another Monitor is needed.",
    "Run source-matched On/Off refusal, initialization, callback shape and lifetime discriminators only after implementation is separately authorized/reviewed. Static body shape, source coordinates, original PR5/PR6/qualified mapping do not close these assertions.",
    "Complete deployment15/minimumSwift6.2 and supported platform conditional typecheck/availability checks, with no new public API/import/dependency assumption. Preserve PR6 watch/final integration/immediate UIKit weak-release holds and final F12/public/release approval independently."
  ],
